@hotelressys_HostAddress = http://localhost:5121

### 1. View all Rooms (Should be empty at first)
GET {{hotelressys_HostAddress}}/rooms

### 2. Add a New Room (Run this so we have something to book)
POST {{hotelressys_HostAddress}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "101",
  "type": "Single",
  "pricePerNight": 100,
  "isAvailable": true
}

### 3. Add Another Room
POST {{hotelressys_HostAddress}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "102",
  "type": "Double",
  "pricePerNight": 150,
  "isAvailable": true
}

### 4. View all Rooms again (You should see your two new rooms with IDs 1 and 2)
GET {{hotelressys_HostAddress}}/rooms

### 5. Book Room 1
POST {{hotelressys_HostAddress}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "guestName": "Jane Doe",
  "checkInDate": "2026-10-01T14:00:00Z",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-10-05T11:00:00Z"
}

### 6. View all Reservations
GET {{hotelressys_HostAddress}}/reservations

### 7. View Rooms (Notice Room 1 is now "isAvailable": false)
GET {{hotelressys_HostAddress}}/rooms